An unknown display refresh rate is reported as 0 Hz (wine's
EnumDisplaySettings gives dmDisplayFrequency 0 when the X server has no
rate, e.g. Xvfb), and computeRefreshPeriod() divided by it: every DXGI
Present() crashed with an integer division by zero in
DxgiOutput::CacheMonitorData().  Treat 0 Hz as an unknown period and count
no refreshes for it.
Unchanged in upstream dxvk master as of 2026-10-22.

